Z||000042||SloPonti||03-11-2001||11:59 PM||||i started with all new parts-new crankshaft and new rods-brand new-new comp cam-i also went with ARP rod and main cap bolts! new hypertectic pistons! basically i just put everything new into the motor and when i could buy parts that were better than stock i did so! you end up with a great 4 banger that will last a lifetime-provided you put together right! most parst are available from summit or jegs! <BR>hope this helps-||||reg||1
